WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:02.980
This is something you have to see.

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:10.620
For weeks now, right wing media has been going
bananas over Joe Biden not having a press

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:11.830
conference.

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:16.720
Joe Biden has now announced a press conference
for next Thursday.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:23.380
And now the problem has become it's bad that
Joe Biden announced the press conference so

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:25.429
far in advance.

00:00:25.429 --> 00:00:30.839
This is once again proof that you can't please
these people and you shouldn't try to please

00:00:30.839 --> 00:00:32.009
these people.

00:00:32.009 --> 00:00:38.719
So as a reminder, the day before yesterday
on Fox, big explosive headline, Biden, 54

00:00:38.719 --> 00:00:45.550
days without a press conference yesterday
on Fox, Joe Biden, 55 days without a press

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:51.950
conference a few days ago in The Washington
Post, quoting Donald Trump's former press

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:54.880
secretary, Kayleigh McEnany.

00:00:54.880 --> 00:01:01.040
Biden isn't doing press conferences because
he's being protected by his staff from unscripted

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:02.380
questions.

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:09.439
Last week, Fox News reporting on the Chicago
Tribune op ed titled How Long Can President

00:01:09.439 --> 00:01:13.119
Biden Hide from Real News Conferences?

00:01:13.119 --> 00:01:20.090
Earlier last week, Fox News with a big table
with the number of days until the first press

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:23.829
conference for the last 16 presidents.

00:01:23.829 --> 00:01:28.350
Last week at the 50 day mark, we got this
stunning report.

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:33.719
President Biden blows off questions from reporters
as he goes 50 days without a formal press

00:01:33.719 --> 00:01:34.719
conference.

00:01:34.719 --> 00:01:41.649
And then yesterday they announce Joe Biden
is going to do a press conference and now

00:01:41.649 --> 00:01:45.039
we get this discussion of suspicion.

00:01:45.039 --> 00:01:49.549
Katie, I have to ask, why in the world would
you announce a press conference nine days

00:01:49.549 --> 00:01:50.869
from now?

00:01:50.869 --> 00:01:55.219
My theory is you announce that morning because
the press is going to come anyway.

00:01:55.219 --> 00:01:57.209
Who knows what's going to happen in nine days?

00:01:57.209 --> 00:01:59.359
Guys, it's just suspicious.

00:01:59.359 --> 00:02:01.610
Why are they announcing the press on?

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:03.139
And so far in advance.

00:02:03.139 --> 00:02:10.580
Well, what about the weeks of reporting about
how Biden is terrible because he's not announcing

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:14.170
and doing a press conference, it's truly pathetic.

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:16.130
They will never be happy.

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:17.580
Don't try to make them happy.

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:19.020
Just don't waste your breath.

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:20.360
Don't waste your energy.

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:23.700
And I actually am looking forward to Biden's
press conference.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:28.450
I look forward to him being asked tough questions
about the things we've been asking about the

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:31.110
border and so many other things.

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:33.680
What's the plan for the 15 dollar minimum
wage?

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:34.900
What's going on with infrastructure?

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:38.310
Do you plan to use budget reconciliation to
get infrastructure done, which we will talk

00:02:38.310 --> 00:02:40.460
about later on in today's program?

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:41.830
I'm very much looking forward to it.

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:45.280
We don't have a schedule yet, but it'll be
sometime next Thursday.

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:51.720
And you can bet that I will be live on YouTube,
on Twitch and on Facebook.

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:59.010
In the meantime, weigh in on this faux scandal
about Joe Biden's press conferences by following

00:02:59.010 --> 00:04:21.930
us on Instagram at David 

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:24.040
Pakman show.

